# Supabase Edge Function Environment Variables
# Copy this to your Supabase project secrets (Project Settings → Edge Functions → Secrets)

# ============================================
# REQUIRED: Core Supabase (auto-configured)
# ============================================
# These are automatically available in Edge Functions:
# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...

# ============================================
# REQUIRED: Stripe Billing
# ============================================
# Get from: https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...

# Create a product and price in Stripe Dashboard, then copy the price ID
# Dashboard → Products → Add Product → Copy price ID (starts with price_)
STRIPE_PRO_PRICE_ID=price_...

# Get from: https://dashboard.stripe.com/webhooks
# After creating webhook endpoint, copy the signing secret
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...

# ============================================
# REQUIRED: AI Features (Anthropic Claude)
# ============================================
# Get from: https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
# This is the platform fallback key. Orgs can also provide their own.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# ============================================
# REQUIRED: Lead Search (Apollo.io)
# ============================================
# Get from: https://app.apollo.io/#/settings/integrations/api
# This is the platform fallback key. Orgs can also provide their own.
APOLLO_API_KEY=...

# ============================================
# REQUIRED: Email Sending (Resend)
# ============================================
# Get from: https://resend.com/api-keys
RESEND_API_KEY=re_...

# ============================================
# OPTIONAL: Twilio Voice/SMS
# ============================================
# Note: Twilio credentials are stored per-organization in the database
# (twilio_credentials table), not as Edge Function secrets.
# Each org configures their own Twilio account in Settings.

# ============================================
# DEPLOYMENT NOTES
# ============================================
# 1. Add these secrets in Supabase Dashboard:
#    Project Settings → Edge Functions → Add secret
#
# 2. For local development with Supabase CLI:
#    supabase secrets set STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
#
# 3. Test mode vs Live mode:
#    - Use sk_test_* keys for beta/testing
#    - Switch to sk_live_* for production
#
# 4. Webhook URLs to configure in external services:
#    - Stripe: https://your-project.supabase.co/functions/v1/stripe-webhook
#    - Twilio Voice: https://your-project.supabase.co/functions/v1/twilio-voice
#    - Twilio Status: https://your-project.supabase.co/functions/v1/twilio-status
